hen and  and who knows it doesn't it doesn't  really matter  i think in the beginning it was just a  lot of  excitement about the whole idea  bright-eyed bushy-tailed i guess  very very optimistic for sure thanks for  checking out this clip from the tim cast  irl podcast  if you want to see the full show come  back to this channel youtube.com  tim cast irl monday through friday at  8pm where you can leave comments  and super chat and we actually will read  your comments  on the show don't forget to like share  subscribe and if you want exclusive  members only content segments you can't  get anywhere else  go to timcast.com become a member and we  even have full bonus episodes  thanks for hanging out and we'll see you  all next time
 

